# The repository root is the deployed artifact — GitHub Pages serves it as
# authored — so anything ignored here is something that must never reach a
# deploy, not merely something not worth committing.

# Agent session state. launch.json is the dev server this project is iterated
# with and belongs to everyone working on it; the rest is per-session scratch.
.claude/*
!.claude/launch.json

# There are no dependencies and no build step, and package.json exists only to
# declare "type": "module". An npm install here would be a mistake rather than
# a setup step, but it would be a served mistake, so it is ignored.
node_modules/

# Desktop cruft. The two platforms the README gives iteration instructions for
# each leave their own, and both would be deployed.
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
